# Loaded by Nx for `nx serve web` only (local development and the e2e tests).
# A placeholder contact form target, so the contact page shows its form. The e2e tests answer the form's requests
# themselves; locally, sending a real enquiry needs a Contact page with a matching `form` block in a Novan space
# (docs/clients/marketing-site.md). To use real values, set them in your shell or in apps/web/.env.serve.local
# (git-ignored), which Nx reads before this file.
MARKETING_CONTACT_ENTRY_ID=00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000c0de
MARKETING_CONTACT_FORM_UID=00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000f0f0
MARKETING_DELIVERY_TOKEN=nv_del_LocalMarketingPlaceholderNotARealToken00
